      279.35
    ],
    "text": "8.(1) The Corporation shall have its own fund and allmoneys heretofore or hereafter to be received by way of gifts,bequest, donation, subscription, contribution, fees or grantsfor and on account of the Corporation shall be deposited tothe credit of the Corperation in one or more banks as theCommittee of Management shall determine.",
    "fonts": [
